cluster C0 hieragglo averagelinkage clusters 10 epsilonplot epsilonplot.dat rms :25,28,29,32,34,35,37,39,40,43,208,211,212,215,216,267,269,270,271,272,273,275,276&!@H= nofit sieve 500 out cnumvtime.dat summary summary.dat info info.dat singlerepout singlerep.pdb singlerepfmt pdb
